  "hasDescription": [
    {
      "@id": "https://data.datatourisme.fr/eca9e57b-28d6-380b-816f-fca0334c1483",
      "dc:description": {
        "de": [
          "Machen Sie sich darauf gefasst, in Candlelight von den betörenden Klängen eines Streichquartetts mitgerissen zu werden.\nAuf dem Programm stehen :\nPirates of the Caribbean - He?s a Pirate (Fluch der Karibik - He?s a Pirate)\nPirates of the Caribbean - Suite\nGladiator - Now We Are Free (Jetzt sind wir frei)\nDer letzte Samurai - Red Warrior\nDune - Medley\nTop Gun ? Maverick\nSherlock Holmes - Discombobulate\nDer König der Löwen - This Land\nBatman Medley\nWonder Woman\nDünkirchen - Supermarine\nInception Medley - Dream Is Collapsing\nInception Medley - Time"
        ],
        "en": [
          "Prepare to be swept away by the mesmerizing sounds of a string quartet at Candlelight.\nOn the program:\nPirates of the Caribbean - He?s a Pirate\nPirates of the Caribbean - Suite\nGladiator - Now We Are Free\nThe Last Samurai - Red Warrior\nDune - Medley\nTop Gun ? Maverick\nSherlock Holmes - Discombobulate\nThe Lion King - This Land\nBatman Medley\nWonder Woman\nDunkirk - Supermarine\nInception Medley - Dream Is Collapsing\nInception Medley - Time"
        ],
        "it": [
          "Preparatevi a lasciarvi trasportare dai suoni incantevoli di un quartetto d'archi a Candlelight.\nIn programma:\nPirati dei Caraibi - Lui è un pirata\nPirati dei Caraibi - Suite\nIl Gladiatore - Ora siamo liberi\nL'ultimo samurai - Guerriero rosso\nDune - Medley\nTop Gun? Maverick\nSherlock Holmes - Discreta\nIl Re Leone - Questa terra\nMedley di Batman\nWonder Woman\nDunkirk - Supermarine\nInception Medley - Il sogno sta crollando\nMedley di Inception - Tempo"
        ],
        "fr": [
          "Préparez-vous à être emporté par les sons envoûtants d'un quatuor à cordes à Candlelight. \nAu programme : \nPirates des Caraïbes - He’s a Pirate\nPirates des Caraïbes - Suite\nGladiator - Now We Are Free\nLe dernier Samouraï - Red Warrior\nDune - Medley\nTop Gun – Maverick\nSherlock Holmes - Discombobulate\nLe Roi Lion - This Land\nBatman Medley\nWonder Woman\nDunkerque - Supermarine\nInception Medley - Dream Is Collapsing\nInception Medley - Time"
        ],
        "es": [
          "Prepárese para dejarse llevar por los encantadores sonidos de un cuarteto de cuerda a la luz de las velas.\nEl programa incluye\nPiratas del Caribe - Es un pirata\nPiratas del Caribe - Suite\nGladiator - Ahora somos libres\nEl último samurái - El guerrero rojo\nDune - Medley\nTop Gun Maverick\nSherlock Holmes - Discombobulate\nEl Rey León - Esta Tierra\nBatman Medley\nLa Mujer Maravilla\nDunkirk - Supermarine\nInception Medley - El Sueño Se Derrumba\nInception Medley - Time"
        ],
        "nl": [
          "Laat je meeslepen door de betoverende klanken van een strijkkwartet bij Candlelight.\nOp het programma:\nPirates of the Caribbean - Hij is een piraat\nPiraten van de Caraïben - Suite\nGladiator - Nu zijn we vrij\nDe laatste samoerai - Rode krijger\nDune - Medley\nTop Gun ? Maverick\nSherlock Holmes - Discombobulate\nDe Leeuwenkoning - Dit Land\nBatman - Medley\nWonder Woman\nDunkirk - Supermarine\nInception Medley - Droom stort in\nInception Medley - Tijd"
        ]
      },
